WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:06.131
♪ ♪

00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:08.434
&gt;&gt; A FEDERAL JUDGE WHO YOU

00:00:08.435 --> 00:00:11.003
APPOINTED HAS JUST RULED THAT

00:00:11.004 --> 00:00:13.672
YOU MUST GIVE CNN REPORTER JOHN

00:00:13.673 --> 00:00:16.642
ACOSTA HIS PRESS PASS BACK.

00:00:16.643 --> 00:00:17.843
YOUR REACTION TO THE RULING?

00:00:17.844 --> 00:00:18.611
&gt;&gt; IT'S FINE.

00:00:18.612 --> 00:00:20.546
IT'S NOT A BIG DEAL.

00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:22.147
WHAT THEY SAID THOUGH IS THAT WE

00:00:22.148 --> 00:00:23.549
HAVE TO CREATE RULES AND

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:24.250
REGULATIONS FOR CONDUCT, ET

00:00:24.251 --> 00:00:25.417
CETERA. WE'RE DOING THAT.

00:00:25.418 --> 00:00:28.354
WE'RE GOING TO WRITE IT UP RIGHT

00:00:28.355 --> 00:00:28.787
NOW.

00:00:28.788 --> 00:00:30.055
IT IS NOT A BIG DEAL.

00:00:30.056 --> 00:00:31.724
IF HE MISBEHAVES, WE'LL THROW

00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:33.659
HIM OUT OR STOP THE NEWS

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:34.560
CONFERENCE.

00:00:34.561 --> 00:00:36.128
IF I THINK SOMEBODY'S ACTING OUT

00:00:36.129 --> 00:00:38.330
OF SORTS, I WILL LEAVE.

00:00:38.331 --> 00:00:40.432
I'LL SAY THANK YOU VERY MUCH,

00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:40.799
EVERYBODY.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.934
I APPRECIATE YOU COMING.

00:00:41.935 --> 00:00:43.035
AND I'LL LEAVE.

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:45.804
AND THOSE REPORTERS WILL NOT BE

00:00:45.805 --> 00:00:46.538
TOO FRIENDLY TO WHOEVER IT IS

00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:47.906
THAT'S ACTING UP.

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:48.907
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:00:48.908 --> 00:00:50.175
DURING AN INTERVIEW THAT WILL

00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:51.944
AIR IN FULL ON FOX NEWS SUNDAY

00:00:51.945 --> 00:00:54.680
WITH CHRIS WALLACE.

00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:57.182
CNN REPORTER ACOSTA HAS REGAINED

00:00:57.183 --> 00:00:59.151
ACCESS TO THE WHITE HOUSE, BUT

00:00:59.152 --> 00:01:02.354
THE ADMINISTRATION IS EXPECTED

00:01:02.355 --> 00:01:04.556
TO ADDRESS REPORTER CONDUCT WITH

00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:07.593
NEW REGULATIONS.

00:01:07.594 --> 00:01:09.962
JOINING US NOW IS SARAH SANDERS.

00:01:09.963 --> 00:01:12.131
SO ONE OF THE STATEMENTS THAT

00:01:12.132 --> 00:01:12.831
CAME OUT OF THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:15.034
TODAY WAS A STATEMENT FROM YOU

00:01:15.035 --> 00:01:16.969
THAT INDICATED THAT THERE WERE

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.971
RULES BEING DEVELOPED AND A

00:01:18.972 --> 00:01:20.272
PROTOCOL BEING DEVELOPED.

00:01:20.273 --> 00:01:21.707
WHEN WILL WE EXPECT TO SEE WHAT

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:22.308
THAT LOOKS LIKE?

00:01:22.309 --> 00:01:25.210
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK THE BIGGEST

00:01:25.211 --> 00:01:27.279
THING TO TAKE AWAY IS -- AND THE

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:30.115
PLACE THAT WE FOCUSED ON IS

00:01:30.116 --> 00:01:32.051
EXACTLY WHAT THE PRESIDENT SAID.

00:01:32.052 --> 00:01:34.453
WE SUPPORT A FREE PRESS, BUT

00:01:34.454 --> 00:01:35.754
FREEDOM OF THE PRESS DOESN'T

00:01:35.755 --> 00:01:39.892
MEAN FREEDOM TO BE DISRUPTIVE,

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:42.027
RUDE, INTERCEPT, AND IMPEDE THE

00:01:42.028 --> 00:01:44.229
ABILITY OF THE COLLEAGUES FROM

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:46.832
ACTUALLY BEING ABLE TO DO THEIR

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:47.833
JOBS, AS WELL AS WHITE HOUSE

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:49.468
STAFF BEING ABLE TO DO THEIRS.

00:01:49.469 --> 00:01:51.370
WE'VE LAID OUT IN A LETTER TO

00:01:51.371 --> 00:01:53.772
CNN AND THEIR TEAM WHAT WE THINK

00:01:53.773 --> 00:01:56.075
WERE SOME OF THE MISSTEPS THAT

00:01:56.076 --> 00:01:57.643
THEIR REPORTER MADE AT THE PRESS

00:01:57.644 --> 00:01:59.912
CONFERENCE ON NOVEMBER 7TH IN A

00:01:59.913 --> 00:02:01.180
LETTER THAT WE SENT THEM

00:02:01.181 --> 00:02:01.580
TONIGHT.

00:02:01.581 --> 00:02:03.849
AND WE EXPECT TO SEE A RESPONSE

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.384
FROM THAT.

00:02:05.385 --> 00:02:09.054
THE JUDGE I THINK WAS ACTUALLY

00:02:09.055 --> 00:02:10.889
VERY CLEAR THAT THE WHITE HOUSE

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.291
HAS THE ABILITY TO SAY, YOU

00:02:12.292 --> 00:02:14.026
CAN'T COME IN.

00:02:14.027 --> 00:02:15.994
YOU DON'T HAVE -- FREEDOM OF THE

00:02:15.995 --> 00:02:17.129
PRESS DOESN'T MEAN FREEDOM INTO

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.697
THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:02:18.698 --> 00:02:21.233
AND HE SAID THERE HAS TO BE DUE

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:21.567
PROCESS.

00:02:21.568 --> 00:02:23.035
THAT'S WHAT WE'RE DOING AND

00:02:23.036 --> 00:02:24.803
WE'LL SEE WHAT HAPPENS FROM

00:02:24.804 --> 00:02:25.104
THERE.

00:02:25.105 --> 00:02:27.106
&gt;&gt; IT WAS A FIFTH AMENDMENT

00:02:27.107 --> 00:02:27.439
RULING.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:30.576
HE NEVER SAID THAT CNN HAD BEEN

00:02:30.577 --> 00:02:32.811
DENIED THEIR FIRST AMENDMENT

00:02:32.812 --> 00:02:33.779
RIGHTS BECAUSE OBVIOUSLY THEY

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.614
CAN SAY WHATEVER THEY WANT.

00:02:35.615 --> 00:02:37.549
THE GOVERNMENT, INCLUDING THE

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.917
WHITE HOUSE HAS NEVER SAID,

00:02:38.918 --> 00:02:40.519
HERE'S WHAT YOU CAN'T SAY.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.688
&gt;&gt; THEY ALSO HAVE 50-PLUS

00:02:42.689 --> 00:02:43.789
ADDITIONAL PEOPLE THAT ARE HARD

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:46.892
PASS OLDERS AT CNN.

00:02:46.893 --> 00:02:49.194
THEY ACTUALLY ARE ONE OF THE

00:02:49.195 --> 00:02:50.095
INDIVIDUAL OUTLETS THAT HAS THE

00:02:50.096 --> 00:02:53.132
MOST HARD PASSES OF ANY NEWS

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:55.834
OUTLET IN THE COUNTRY IS CNN.

00:02:55.835 --> 00:02:57.703
THEY'RE ONE OF THE TOP THREE.

00:02:57.704 --> 00:02:59.972
SO THE IDEA THAT THEY AREN'T

00:02:59.973 --> 00:03:01.306
ABLE TO GET INFORMATION THEY

00:03:01.307 --> 00:03:03.475
NEED FROM THE WHITE HOUSE IS

00:03:03.476 --> 00:03:04.476
FRANEDLY LAUGHABLE.

00:03:04.477 --> 00:03:07.212
&gt;&gt; HOW MANY SEATS ARE IN THAT

00:03:07.213 --> 00:03:11.150
TRESS  PRESS ROOM?

00:03:11.151 --> 00:03:13.051
&gt;&gt; 49 SEATS.

00:03:13.052 --> 00:03:15.954
&gt;&gt; WHO GETS TO DECIDE WHOSE REAR

00:03:15.955 --> 00:03:17.756
ENDS OCCUPY 49 SEATS AND HOW

00:03:17.757 --> 00:03:19.958
COME THEY GET THEM AND THOUSANDS

00:03:19.959 --> 00:03:22.094
OF OTHERS NEVER DO?

00:03:22.095 --> 00:03:25.431
&gt;&gt; WE WORK WITH THE WHITE HOUSE

00:03:25.432 --> 00:03:26.331
CORRESPONDENTS ASSOCIATION.

00:03:26.332 --> 00:03:28.033
THEY ARE THE PRIMARY PEOPLE WHO

00:03:28.034 --> 00:03:29.234
HELP DETERMINE WHO THOSE SEATS

00:03:29.235 --> 00:03:29.835
BELONG TO.

00:03:29.836 --> 00:03:31.670
&gt;&gt; DO THEY GET TO PICK THEM OR

00:03:31.671 --> 00:03:34.940
CAN YOU SAY, OKAY, ON THIS NEXT

00:03:34.941 --> 00:03:37.075
THURSDAY WE'RE GOING TO HAVE

00:03:37.076 --> 00:03:38.477
JOURNALISTS FROM ANYWHERE IN THE

00:03:38.478 --> 00:03:40.579
COUNTRY EXCEPT WASHINGTON.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.613
&gt;&gt; THE ASSOCIATION DETERMINES

00:03:41.614 --> 00:03:42.915
WHO SITS IN THAT ROOM.

00:03:42.916 --> 00:03:43.682
&gt;&gt; THAT'S TRADITION.

00:03:43.683 --> 00:03:45.517
IT'S NOT LAW.

00:03:45.518 --> 00:03:45.984
? TRUE.

00:03:45.985 --> 00:03:48.520
&gt;&gt; AND SO IF THERE WAS A DESIRE

00:03:48.521 --> 00:03:50.522
TO GIVE OTHER JOURNALISTS AN

00:03:50.523 --> 00:03:51.957
OPPORTUNITY TO DO IT, BECAUSE I

00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:53.459
THINK SOME PEOPLE SEE THESE SAME

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.693
FOLKS IN THERE EVERY DAY AND

00:03:54.694 --> 00:03:57.396
THEY SAY, HOW COME THEY GET TO

00:03:57.397 --> 00:04:00.966
DO IT?

00:04:00.967 --> 00:04:03.268
I'M SURE THERE'S BROADCASTERS

00:04:03.269 --> 00:04:04.937
WHO WOULD LOVE TO ASK THE

00:04:04.938 --> 00:04:06.171
PRESIDENT QUESTIONS.

00:04:06.172 --> 00:04:07.873
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT'S CERTAINLY AN

00:04:07.874 --> 00:04:09.775
OPTION TO EXPLORE AND MAYBE WE

00:04:09.776 --> 00:04:10.476
WILL IN THIS WHITE HOUSE.

00:04:10.477 --> 00:04:13.111
I KNOW THE PRESIDENT IS ONE OF

00:04:13.112 --> 00:04:16.148
THE MOST ACCESSIBLE PRESIDENTS

00:04:16.149 --> 00:04:17.015
PROBABLY EVER BUT CERTAINLY IN

00:04:17.016 --> 00:04:17.816
MODERN HISTORY.

00:04:17.817 --> 00:04:21.887
HE'S TAKEN IN THE LAST SIX WEEKS

00:04:21.888 --> 00:04:22.888
LEADING UP TO THE MIDTERMS HE

00:04:22.889 --> 00:04:25.057
TOOK 300 TIMES THE NUMBER OF

00:04:25.058 --> 00:04:27.693
QUESTIONS FROM REPORTERS THAN

00:04:27.694 --> 00:04:30.128
EITHER OF HIS PREDECESSORS.

00:04:30.129 --> 00:04:37.503
THAT'S OUTRAGEOUS TO PRETEND HE

00:04:37.504 --> 00:04:38.570
DOESN'T SUPPORT THE PRESS.

00:04:38.571 --> 00:04:40.239
HE'S SOMEBODY WHO LOVES TO

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.573
ENGAGE WITH THE PRESS.

00:04:41.574 --> 00:04:42.474
&gt;&gt; WE'VE NOTICED THAT.

00:04:42.475 --> 00:04:43.108
WE HAVE.

00:04:43.109 --> 00:04:44.676
&gt;&gt; AND THAT'S BECAUSE HE LOVES

00:04:44.677 --> 00:04:46.044
TO BE ABLE TO SPEAK DIRECTLY TO

00:04:46.045 --> 00:04:46.879
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.614
WE NEVER WANT TO PROHIBIT THAT

00:04:48.615 --> 00:04:50.482
FROM TAKING PLACE, BUT AT THE

00:04:50.483 --> 00:04:52.384
SAME TIME, THOSE INDIVIDUALS

00:04:52.385 --> 00:04:53.619
CAN'T BE DISRUPTIVE.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.787
THEY CAN'T IMPEDE THE ABILITY OF

00:04:55.788 --> 00:04:58.657
ANY INDIVIDUAL TO DO THEIR JOBS.

00:04:58.658 --> 00:05:01.593
&gt;&gt; SO WHEN MIGHT WE SEE THE

00:05:01.594 --> 00:05:04.730
RULES OR THE REQUIREMENTS, THE

00:05:04.731 --> 00:05:05.230
PROTOCOL?

00:05:05.231 --> 00:05:06.632
YOU'VE SAID YOU SENT THE LETTER

00:05:06.633 --> 00:05:07.299
TO CNN TONIGHT.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.767
IS THAT GOING TO BE IN A FEW

00:05:08.768 --> 00:05:10.435
DAYS, FEW WEEKS?

00:05:10.436 --> 00:05:12.337
&gt;&gt; WE'LL WORK WITH OUR TEAM ON

00:05:12.338 --> 00:05:14.506
THAT AND CERTAINLY MOVING INTO

00:05:14.507 --> 00:05:15.440
THANKSGIVING HOLIDAY WE'LL SEE

00:05:15.441 --> 00:05:17.376
HOW LONG THAT PROCESS TAKES, BUT

00:05:17.377 --> 00:05:18.110
I THINK THERE ARE SOME JUST

00:05:18.111 --> 00:05:19.311
STANDARD PRACTICES.

00:05:19.312 --> 00:05:23.415
LOOK, I THINK THE VERY BASIC

00:05:23.416 --> 00:05:24.816
MINIMUM IS THAT IF CERTAIN

00:05:24.817 --> 00:05:26.318
REPORTERS LIKE JIM ACOSTA CAN'T

00:05:26.319 --> 00:05:29.254
BE ADULTS, THEN CNN NEEDS TO

00:05:29.255 --> 00:05:31.924
SEND SOMEBODY IN THERE WHO CAN

00:05:31.925 --> 00:05:32.190
BE.

00:05:32.191 --> 00:05:34.226
&gt;&gt; IF HE ASKED THREE QUESTIONS

00:05:34.227 --> 00:05:36.762
WHEN HE WAS ONLY SUPPOSED TO ASK

00:05:36.763 --> 00:05:38.497
ONE, DOES THAT MAKE THE

00:05:38.498 --> 00:05:39.298
REPORTERS TICKED OFF?

00:05:39.299 --> 00:05:41.600
&gt;&gt; I'LL LEAVE THAT TO THEM.

00:05:41.601 --> 00:05:43.135
BUT CERTAINLY PRIVATELY A NUMBER

00:05:43.136 --> 00:05:45.337
OF THEM HAVE EXPRESSED THEIR

00:05:45.338 --> 00:05:47.005
DISPLEASURE WITH THE FACT OF HIS

00:05:47.006 --> 00:05:48.774
GRANDSTANDING AND THE POSITION

00:05:48.775 --> 00:05:50.876
THAT HE OFTEN PUTS A LOT OF THEM

00:05:50.877 --> 00:05:51.376
IN.

00:05:51.377 --> 00:05:54.112
AND IT'S CERTAINLY NOT SOMETHING

00:05:54.113 --> 00:05:55.948
THEY WANT TO CELEBRATE NOR

00:05:55.949 --> 00:05:56.315
DEFEND.

00:05:56.316 --> 00:05:58.383
&gt;&gt; LET'S MOVE TO TOMORROW.

00:05:58.384 --> 00:06:02.087
YOU'LL BE LOOKING AT HORRIFIC

00:06:02.088 --> 00:06:03.822
SCENES, WORST FIRES IN THE

00:06:03.823 --> 00:06:05.123
HISTORY OF THE COUNTRY.

00:06:05.124 --> 00:06:09.227
63 KNOWN DEAD, 600 UNACCOUNTED

00:06:09.228 --> 00:06:09.494
FOR.

00:06:09.495 --> 00:06:10.629
WHAT WILL THE PRESIDENT HOPE TO

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.130
SAY TOMORROW?

00:06:12.131 --> 00:06:13.365
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE SIMPLEST MESSAGE

00:06:13.366 --> 00:06:13.932
IS THAT WE'RE HERE.

00:06:13.933 --> 00:06:15.133
WE'RE THERE FOR YOU.

00:06:15.134 --> 00:06:17.603
WE WILL DO ANY AND EVERYTHING WE

00:06:17.604 --> 00:06:18.937
CAN TO PROVIDE FEDERAL

00:06:18.938 --> 00:06:20.439
ASSISTANCE AND FEDERAL

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:20.806
RESOURCES.

00:06:20.807 --> 00:06:23.041
HE CONVEYED THAT I KNOW IN A

00:06:23.042 --> 00:06:24.276
CALL TO GOVERNOR BROWN EARLIER

00:06:24.277 --> 00:06:24.743
THIS WEEK.

00:06:24.744 --> 00:06:27.079
HE'LL BE JOINING US WHEN WE GET

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.347
TO CALIFORNIA TOMORROW.

00:06:28.348 --> 00:06:29.681
I THINK THIS WILL ACTUALLY

00:06:29.682 --> 00:06:32.517
PROBABLY BE ONE OF THE HARDER

00:06:32.518 --> 00:06:34.853
DAYS THAT WE'VE HAD IN THE TWO

00:06:34.854 --> 00:06:36.521
YEARS OF THIS ADMINISTRATION,

00:06:36.522 --> 00:06:39.458
NOT ONLY VISITING WITH THE

00:06:39.459 --> 00:06:41.693
HORRIFIC AND SEEING THE SCENES

00:06:41.694 --> 00:06:45.297
OF THE HORRIFIC WILDFIRES THAT

00:06:45.298 --> 00:06:46.698
HAVE RAVAGED CALIFORNIA, BUT

00:06:46.699 --> 00:06:47.466
ALSO TALKING WITH SOME OF THE

00:06:47.467 --> 00:06:49.134
PEOPLE AND THE FAMILIES THAT

00:06:49.135 --> 00:06:51.203
WERE IMPACTED BY THE SHOOTING

00:06:51.204 --> 00:06:53.538
THERE NOT TOO LONG AGO.

00:06:53.539 --> 00:06:54.840
IT'S GOING TO BE A VERY

00:06:54.841 --> 00:06:56.475
DIFFICULT AND EMOTIONAL DAY, AND

00:06:56.476 --> 00:06:58.644
I THINK THE BIGGEST TAKEAWAY

00:06:58.645 --> 00:07:00.779
WILL BE THE PRESIDENT SAYING,

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.481
WE'RE HERE.

00:07:02.482 --> 00:07:04.983
AND THANFULLY THE PRESIDENT'S

00:07:04.984 --> 00:07:06.418
GOT BIG SHOULDERS AND I THINK

00:07:06.419 --> 00:07:08.320
HE'S GOING TO GO THERE TO OFFER

00:07:08.321 --> 00:07:12.324
THEM UP TO PEOPLE THAT NEED

00:07:12.325 --> 00:07:12.791
THEM.

00:07:12.792 --> 00:07:14.259
&gt;&gt; WE'VE ONLY GOT A MINUTE AND A

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.161
HALF LEFT, BUT I WANT TO COVER

00:07:16.162 --> 00:07:21.800
THIS BECAUSE I DIDN'T SEE A LOT

00:07:21.801 --> 00:07:23.402
IN THE MAINSTREAM MEDIA.

00:07:23.403 --> 00:07:25.303
YOU HAD PEOPLE THAT REALLY

00:07:25.304 --> 00:07:29.107
RANGED THE FULL SPECTRUM.

00:07:29.108 --> 00:07:30.175
I WAS INVOLVED IN THIS.

00:07:30.176 --> 00:07:32.077
ONE OF THE COMMITTEES TO HELP

00:07:32.078 --> 00:07:33.912
TRAP SOME OF THE POLICY BASED ON

00:07:33.913 --> 00:07:35.080
MY OWN EXPERIENCES.

00:07:35.081 --> 00:07:37.015
THIS WAS HUGE.

00:07:37.016 --> 00:07:37.649
THIS WAS MAJOR.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.819
GIVE ME A SYNOPSIS OF WHAT THIS

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.520
LEGISLATION DOES THAT THE

00:07:41.521 --> 00:07:42.354
PRESIDENT PUSHED THIS WEEK.

00:07:42.355 --> 00:07:44.523
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK ONE OF THE

00:07:44.524 --> 00:07:47.359
BIGGEST THINGS IS IT BRINGS THE

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.226
COUNTRY TOGETHER.

00:07:48.227 --> 00:07:51.463
IT'S A BIPARTISAN, AND AREA

00:07:51.464 --> 00:07:52.898
WHERE REPUBLICANS, DEMOCRATS,

00:07:52.899 --> 00:07:53.999
EVERYONE CAN COME TOGETHER AND

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.600
AGREE THAT THIS IS A GOOD THING

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:57.869
TO SHOW A LITTLE GRACE AND A

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.404
LITTLE MERCY IN OUR JUSTICE

00:07:59.405 --> 00:08:00.439
SYSTEM.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:01.673
SOMETHING THAT HASN'T BEEN DONE

00:08:01.674 --> 00:08:03.375
IN A LONG TIME.

00:08:03.376 --> 00:08:08.180
WE'VE HAD DECADES' WORTH OF BAD

00:08:08.181 --> 00:08:08.814
DECISIONS THAT HAVE BEEN

00:08:08.815 --> 00:08:12.551
IMPROPERLY PLACED PEOPLE AND

00:08:12.552 --> 00:08:13.618
REALLY I THINK LONGER SENTENCES

00:08:13.619 --> 00:08:15.821
THAN THEY DESERVED, NOT ALLOWED

00:08:15.822 --> 00:08:17.089
PEOPLE TO HAVE A LIFE AFTER

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:17.489
PRISON.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.356
AND THIS IS SOMETHING THAT IS

00:08:18.357 --> 00:08:19.958
VERY IMPORTANT TO THE PRESIDENT,

00:08:19.959 --> 00:08:22.661
VERY IMPORTANT TO JARED KUSHNER,

00:08:22.662 --> 00:08:24.796
WHO'S DONE A TREMENDOUS JOB IN

00:08:24.797 --> 00:08:26.765
HELPING DEVELOP AND REALLY WORK

00:08:26.766 --> 00:08:28.300
THIS.

00:08:28.301 --> 00:08:29.234
THIS ISN'T SOMETHING THAT

00:08:29.235 --> 00:08:29.768
HAPPENED OVERNIGHT.

00:08:29.769 --> 00:08:31.103
I THINK YOU SAW A LITTLE BIT OF

00:08:31.104 --> 00:08:32.838
THE CULMINATION OF THAT.

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:34.239
&gt;&gt; HE SHOULD GET THE CREDIT FOR

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.907
THAT AND I HOPE HE WILL.

00:08:35.908 --> 00:08:38.076
30 SECONDS AND THAT'S ALL WE'VE

00:08:38.077 --> 00:08:38.343
GOT.

00:08:38.344 --> 00:08:41.379
EARLIER TAMMY BRUCE SAID SARAH

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:43.882
SANDERS IS GOING TO BE LEAVING

00:08:43.883 --> 00:08:44.349
THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.317
IS THERE SOMETHING YOU NEED TO

